<title>UK: Royal Bank shares off on BZW downgrade.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank shares off on BZW downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Royal Bank of Scotland tumbled on heavy volume on Tuesday after brokerage BZW downgraded the stock, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0743 GMT, the shares were off 9-1/2p to 526p on trading volume of 491,937. They were among the most heavily traded shares in London.</p>
</text>
